{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"湊かなえさんの「少女」が読み終わりました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これまで読んだ湊かなえさんの作品の中では\n1番好きな話でした!!\n(といってもまだ4冊しか読んでいない)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少女たちが自分と同じくらいの歳なので\n共感できる点が多々あり\n感情移入して読むことができました!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に素敵な話だと思います!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少女たちの狂気的な部分の描写も\nとても面白いです!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏休み前に読むのが丁度いいかも!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非読んでみて下さい!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"------ ✂︎ｷﾘﾄﾘｾﾝ ✂︎------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN46DRF02JSRB1JZGAZZKVS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今私が愛用しているシャーペンたちです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか紹介したくなったので紹介しました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ぺんてる」と「ZEBRA」です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれも書きやすくて好きなのですが1番好きなのはピンクのぺんてるです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色も凄く可愛いし軽くて持ちやすい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上シャーペンの紹介でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"------ ✂︎ｷﾘﾄﾘｾﾝ ✂︎------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"《連載》ぽ ん か ん さ つ #24"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐドラマが始まりますね!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も出来上がったものはまだ見ていないのでとてもドキドキワクワクしています!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここで撮影の休憩時間中のゆいぽんの様子を覗いてみましょう ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN46FGZX44FZYX3CT3C5RSA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆が携帯をいじっている中\nなにやらゆいぽんはゴミ箱の「PUSH」の文字を見ているようです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それを…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN46H5970F35K1QCXGZVAEM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「PUSH!!!!!!!」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいいぃぃぃぃいいいい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"子供っぽい一面が垣間見れました( ´ ▽ ` )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も可愛いゆいぽんなのでした〜(今日のわんこ風)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいばい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なな"}],"source":"archive"}